<title>JAPAN: Miyaji Iron Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Miyaji Iron Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.04		vs	   18.99</p>
<p> Operating	  676    million	  vs	  819    million</p>
<p> Current	    730    million	  vs	  785    million</p>
<p> Net		  267    million	  vs	  276    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.05 yen	  vs	    4.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     66 million	  vs	  65 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Miyaji Iron Works Co Ltd constructs bridges and produces steelframes.</p>
</text>
